    "name": "Miner Crysis",
    "steam_appid": 3674200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miner Crysis</strong> is a 2D sci-fi mining adventure where you pilot a customizable drill-ship beneath the surface of a dying moon. With only an AI companion to guide you after being abandoned, you must uncover the moon\u2019s secrets and survive its many dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Mining Exploration</strong>: Dig through layers of destructible terrain in a vast, interconnected underground world filled with hidden chambers, rare resources, and ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Improve your drill-ship with enhanced drills, armor plating, boosters, and weapons. Tailor your build to fit your playstyle\u2014faster, tougher, or more heavily armed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Trading</strong>: Extract valuable ores and trade them at underground vendors for credits to purchase upgrades, fuel, and repair parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Alien Threats</strong>: Face hostile subterranean creatures, defense drones, and environmental hazards. Use your weapons strategically to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiation &amp; Survival Mechanics</strong>: Venture deeper and face rising eternium radiation levels. Equip shielding and monitor your ship\u2019s vitals to avoid a quick death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story &amp; Lore</strong>: Piece together the mystery of the collapsing moon through datapads, NPC dialogue, and environmental storytelling. Discover what happened\u2014and whether you can stop it from happening again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Side Missions</strong>: Complete main story objectives and optional quests given by robotic allies scattered across the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser-Sealed Doors &amp; Secret Rooms</strong>: Unlock new areas using datapads found in hidden rooms or dropped by bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon is on the brink of collapse\u2014its core held together by a volatile crystal-powered device. Can you unlock its secrets before everything comes crashing down?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miner Crysis</strong> is a 2D sci-fi mining adventure where you pilot a customizable drill-ship beneath the surface of a dying moon. With only an AI companion to guide you after being abandoned, you must uncover the moon\u2019s secrets and survive its many dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Mining Exploration</strong>: Dig through layers of destructible terrain in a vast, interconnected underground world filled with hidden chambers, rare resources, and ancient secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong>: Improve your drill-ship with enhanced drills, armor plating, boosters, and weapons. Tailor your build to fit your playstyle\u2014faster, tougher, or more heavily armed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering &amp; Trading</strong>: Extract valuable ores and trade them at underground vendors for credits to purchase upgrades, fuel, and repair parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Alien Threats</strong>: Face hostile subterranean creatures, defense drones, and environmental hazards. Use your weapons strategically to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radiation &amp; Survival Mechanics</strong>: Venture deeper and face rising eternium radiation levels. Equip shielding and monitor your ship\u2019s vitals to avoid a quick death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story &amp; Lore</strong>: Piece together the mystery of the collapsing moon through datapads, NPC dialogue, and environmental storytelling. Discover what happened\u2014and whether you can stop it from happening again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Side Missions</strong>: Complete main story objectives and optional quests given by robotic allies scattered across the depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\